To return to the original error recovery function (viewing individual
errors and the corresponding recovery messages), select "Error Recovery"
from the "View" menu.


Shortcut for returning to PALASM 4 from online help
---------------------------------------------------
As an alternative to selecting "Quit," from the online help menu bar,
you can return to PALASM 4 at any time simply by pressing the F10 key.
(If a dialogue box is open, you must first press Esc to close the
dialogue box.)
